<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Digital Business Card</title>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: darkslategrey;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        .card {
            background-color: white;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            width: 350px;
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .profile-img {
            /* Fixed: 230px was too wide for a 350px card. Scaled down slightly to fit beautifully */
            width: 180px;
            height: 180px;
            /* Fixed: border-radius must be exactly 50% to make a perfect circle */
            border-radius: 50%;
            object-fit: cover;
            border: 6px solid steelblue;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 24px;
            color: #333333; 
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .title {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: blue;
            /* Fixed: font-weight maximum value is 900 */
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .bio {
            font-size: 15px;
            color: red;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            text-align: left;
            background-color: whitesmoke;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border-left: 4px solid steelblue;
        }

        .HOBBIES {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            /* Fixed: flex-wrap values must be 'wrap' or 'nowrap', not a color */
            flex-wrap: wrap; 
        }

        .badge {
            background-color: lightgray;
            color: black;
            padding: 6px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="card">
        <img class="profile-img" src="2026300023_pariyarmanoj.jpeg" alt="Profile Picture">
        
        <h1>MANOJ PARIYAR</h1>
        <div class="title">STUDENT <br> SEOUL THEOLOGICAL UNIVERSITY</div>
        
        <p class="bio">
            MY HOMETOWN IS DANG, NEPAL. <br>
            <!-- Fixed: Added the compulsory computer experience required by the assignment rubric -->
            I HAVE SOME EXPERIENCE USING COMPUTERS.<br><br>
            MY HOBBIES ARE BELOW:
        </p>
        
        <div class="HOBBIES">
            <span class="badge">PLAYING FOOTBALL</span>
            <span class="badge">LEARNING PROGRAMMING</span>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
